    "per_pillar_md": {
      "P1": "Score: 1.70/5.0 (level 2 Developing)\nCFC demonstrates above-median maturity in digital strategy formulation and ESG integration. However, governance structures lag peer median (: 2.25 vs. 2.75). Limited documented digital risk appetite frameworks or innovation governance (E-202, https://www.capitalfarmcredit.com/corporate-governance, E-312 [https://ww3.fca.gov/readingrm/exammanual/General%20Guidance/Board%20Policies%20and%20Charters.pdf]).",
      "P2": "Score: 1.60/5.0 (level 2 Developing)\nLowest score reflecting member experience gaps across marketing and acquisition channels. (Personalization, 3.0) is strength via Dynamics 365 CRM. However, (Digital Marketing, 2.0) lags peer median by 0.50 points\u2014Q2 digital banking operational but underutilized for member acquisition (E-200, https://www.capitalfarmcredit.com/about-us, E-201 [https://www.capitalfarmcredit.com/services], E-329 [https://www.q2.com/products/digital-banking/distributed-cloud-architecture]).",
      "P3": "Score: 2.10/5.0 (level 2 Developing)\n (Core Process Automation, 3.0) is level 3 strength\u2014equipment valuation standardized via Tractor Zoom Pro; collateral appraisal workflow automated. (Compliance, 2.75) above peer median reflecting FCA compliance leadership background (E-300, https://www.tractorzoompro.com/our-solutions/automated-equipment-lists/capital-farm-credit-boosts-appraisal-and-inspection-efficiency-with-equipment-lists, E-310 [https://www.capitalfarmcredit.com/about-us/leadership/], E-312 [https://ww3.fca.gov/readingrm/exammanual/General%20Guidance/Board%20Policies%20and%20Charters.pdf]).",
      "P4": "Score: 2.00/5.0 (level 2 Developing)\n (Technology Architecture, 2.75) shows modern infrastructure investment\u2014Microsoft Azure, Dynamics 365, Oracle HCM Cloud. (Cybersecurity, 2.25) above peer median. However, and at/below median. Analytics maturity lag limits competitive advantage in credit decisioning (E-327, https://rocketreach.co/capital-farm-credit-technology-stack_b5d54e08f42e3a32, E-328 [https://www.capitalfarmcredit.com/about-us/leadership/])."
    },
